{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>What?</strong></i></u><br>Its a 2D retro style rampage runner with action RPG elements like skill upgrades. <br><br><u><i><strong>Support real artists.</strong></i></u><br>Discover free music cassettes through-out the game. With them you can create your own game playlists. Find something special? Check our music store and support the artists you like directly by purchasing more of their music. We split the music store revenue with them. No AI!  No crazy Spotify revenue share diffraction.<br><br><u><i><strong>Animal friendly.</strong></i></u><br>Support real rescue dogs by purchasing our merch. Cat person? No worries, the revenue share goes to animal shelters which includes a lot of cats too!</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3768670?t=1750187734","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768670/8eaf975116359103dd85c86b0c84877acd80df94/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1750187734","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768670/a79feda48b0e42829cb4eeb0ea074fc084f77742/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1750187734","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3768670/a79feda48b0e42829cb4eeb0ea074fc084f77742/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1750187734","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"In-App Purchases","id":35},{"description":"Color Alternatives","id":66},{"description":"Custom Volume Controls","id":68},{"description":"Mouse Only Option","id":76},{"description":"Stereo Sound","id":69},{"description":"Touch Only Option","id":77},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><u><i><strong>What?</strong></i></u><br>Its a 2D retro style rampage runner with action RPG elements like skill upgrades. <br><br><u><i><strong>Support real artists.</strong></